    rdfs:comment "An enterprise-grade permissioned ereum fork, initiated by JPMorgan Chase's Blockchain Centre of Excellence and open-sourced under Apache 2.0 that extends the ereum protocol with private transaction envelopes managed by the Tessera privacy manager (successor to Constellation, implemented v..."@en ;
